{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "6789f2b90dc51432f993f6e3bc5c9ff4079f07e26407939113fde82da863542a", "ja": "騒乱の選挙戦", "zh": "骚乱的选战", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d080d6205deefaeb3cdc829f894c1105ee6b6d961f0acb7fb58fb7bcfdf37338", "ja": "美希の独特な選挙活動に不満を抱いた静香は\n改善を訴えるが、千早は「やり方は美希が\n決める」「高坂さんは私の友達ではない」と\n返して立ち去る。可憐と親しげな昴を見た\n千早は、昴に八つ当たりをしてしまう。", "zh": "静香对美希独特的竞选活动感到不满，提出应该改进，但千早回答说“做法由美希决定”“高坂同学不是我的朋友”，然后转身离去。千早看到昴和可怜亲密的样子，便把怒气发泄到了昴身上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1000_047sub", "source_sha256": "f719d3ae8448308c2447ea79e7591d33b3f759b136fd81debd6a9105fed76403", "ja": "その後、恵美さんが副会長。\n高坂さんが生徒会長に立候補した。", "zh": "在那之后，惠美学姐参选副会长，\n高坂学姐参选了学生会长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "b968f48adb611481d75acbb9f0dba29a013c670b397c0d1f20db419ded627ec6", "ja": "数日後、全ての立候補者が公示され、\nいよいよミリオン女学園の生徒会選挙が始まった……", "zh": "几天后，所有的候选人都已公布，\n百万女学园的学生会选举终于拉开了帷幕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1002_josiseito1", "source_sha256": "4596fd9825aafe989c70826ed71bcd91ed825de1fd3f0843a9d9f04f6aaa14a2", "ja": "美希さん！　あの、私、応援してます！", "zh": "美希小姐！那个，我一直在为你加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "f57a9099ae4d514a05b8b3904818193771ed96d1699483f0f0f3437c4b85de3a", "ja": "本当？　ありがとうなの～！　じゃあ生徒会長は、\n美希に清き一票を、よろしくなの♪", "zh": "真的？谢谢你～！那么，学生会长请把神圣的一票投给美希吧，拜托啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1004_josiseito2", "source_sha256": "b0c2e78f5eee4c3100c1f2a9e107a7b4b5ac94252416a21b37b238bec07bc870", "ja": "美希さん、握手してください！", "zh": "美希小姐，请和我握手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "dbe9a5ef3617597bf46972b6eb7a773913eb15af365b829f4de07c4f1dc36175", "ja": "いーよ？　一緒に写真撮る？", "zh": "好～啊？要一起合照吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "86f6f26c1e918e184aea44583ff593250f3a175118a1ff24afaefb764700ea62", "ja": "何なの、あれ……！", "zh": "那是什么啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1007_se", "source_sha256": "6067586b6ee6ba9da8eec9ea2b642802924e13930c1f7af264199c4b54c7698d", "ja": "バタバタバタ……！", "zh": "啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "10b1a1861096bffcba5bf4950f3f4f035f8ab3da850ce2f3d0fd1c3771c62123", "ja": "千早！！！", "zh": "千早！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "9d4171243f35748fb83ee34176ffd7e34b3d29069085a5b9285e039704ea080e", "ja": "美希さんの選挙活動、あれは何？　いくらなんでも\nあんまりだわ。貴女がついていながら……！", "zh": "美希小姐的选举活动是怎么回事？不管怎么说也太过分了。明明有你跟着她……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "8c72a53d193ee6cd95376ef338d300e0f3431aac3cfd6dd61085c1f7ac6c2305", "ja": "何って……美希さんの選挙だもの。\n私は、推薦人を頼まれただけ。", "zh": "“什么叫……那是美希的竞选活动啊。\n我只是受托当推荐人而已。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "6053921aa3e29adb5881ec1a2580f169116ceaca2c354402537e51445c804b81", "ja": "やり方は、美希さんが決める。\n私にそんな権利はないわ。", "zh": "做法由美希定。\n我没有那种权力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "4123211793c9462a943121836e444e31356cb492864c4137ee252d64848f7b17", "ja": "そんな……！\n貴女は美希さんの推薦人なのに、無責任よ。", "zh": "怎么会……！\n明明您是美希的推荐人，却这么不负责任。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "bad64702bbe991cd4d8fc9f045c91d283739e125d7ddd87e88c1d5a1f35d5db4", "ja": "何もしなくていいと言われているから。", "zh": "因为有人告诉我要什么都不用做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "d1e97071ba69646d7b5b7a4e1ad4215d88e5c2da9c8f512a1a548143a6c00323", "ja": "だったら……やる気がないのなら、最初から\n海美を応援してくれればよかったのに……。", "zh": "既然这样……要是没打算帮忙的话，一开始就支持海美不就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "0fd4ae5948ebaeef333b7d4158c6e2344e8b8df918d77ab7c7aa745c23743a87", "ja": "……高坂さんは貴女の友達かもしれないけど、\n私の友達ではないわ。", "zh": "……高坂同学或许是你的朋友，\n但并不是我的朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "1f8f7a7d632330f5839caf59573eee0fe0233f8ac9f775d077792523ece9dd23", "ja": "だから、私には関係ない。\n……もう、行くわ。", "zh": "所以，这和我没关系。\n……我先走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "d8d317677ae1ded44942e6ee50a71acaf3a5fff85483aaa22c77123894ac8c34", "ja": "千早……。", "zh": "千早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "d14cb11a55b7eafe8ed19686cf3444231a5809a622c5b2fadff83fc67e151756", "ja": "何よ……先に私をひとりにしたのは、\n貴女のほうじゃない……。", "zh": "什么嘛……先丢下我一个人的人，\n明明是你才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "72c59a743bed84625e368103d65c467b4fca92d4300477f74c129311852bf9ef", "ja": "あっ……千早さん！\n可憐さん、千早さんですよ！", "zh": "啊……千早小姐！\n可怜小姐，是千早小姐哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "5d26dc9f4de5c694bb3db59ba296c0d55cae7f414cee436b4c962ee04de9de62", "ja": "っ……！\nどうして……。", "zh": "……！\n为什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "41f95ff3371c1e6d63c6d5d2122820cbab1d5f6934b89b319856a6f6f69634e5", "ja": "？　千早さん……？", "zh": "？千早姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "b35a5ead3984ed1d34d72a96758d3d8dffdb53677d6668c254a63bc0cf3767e4", "ja": "そこは……そこは、私の場所よ！", "zh": "那里……那里是我的位置！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "8bcabaccade4bdd36cb9edcfc05802b844662867b04a728e1ea15afdf42fccd7", "ja": "可憐お姉さまは、私のお姉さまよ！\n貴女のじゃないわ……！", "zh": "可怜姐姐大人，是我的姐姐大人！\n才不是你的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "1ae6ea286f3dfe01ee5f9b9862c172619ad7b03f96f79ffe0502506659d16d86", "ja": "！！　わたし、そんなつもりじゃ……\nご、ごめんなさい！！", "zh": "！！我、我不是那个意思……\n对、对不起！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "fb397ac5e41cf70a07e16855152291f26f2b0d9693cd317c857ba935388f7f73", "ja": "あっ、昴さん……！", "zh": "啊，昴……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "7d252e9c29005d00ce695bd930b6ac1ef405ecf3427a94bcb8116899a718b6ee", "ja": "……千早。今のは、八つ当たりね？\n私の妹は、貴女……わからないとは言わせないわ。", "zh": "……千早。刚才那下，是在迁怒吧？\n我的妹妹，你……可别跟我说你不知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "31703fc529c7356168a8b6eea5e07d53343665084bbda29bc3a36828f2b1e2ba", "ja": "あ……私……。", "zh": "啊……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "8c7a982e3d731c1c3db4253b857e601dbe4d8070a1a735afcef2d3d444db4ac6", "ja": "……最上さんと、何かあったの？", "zh": "……你和最上同学，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1031_002chi", "source_sha256": "0031fabae91fb71705d5dc8233c29284e846aa2db267796bd7ba71e84476764c", "ja": "私……静香に、ひどいことを言いました。\n最初に静香をひとりにしたのは、私なのに……。", "zh": "我……对静香说了很过分的话。\n明明最开始把静香一个人留下的是我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "c81aa773cf3ba62e31388af7d99dfb4460492796561e4be35fd5ad16e60a5695", "ja": "姉妹になってすぐの頃、貴女は私にべったりだった。\n……私も、もうすこし気を付けるべきだったわ。", "zh": "刚成为姐妹的那阵子，你一直很粘我。\n……我也本该更加留心一些的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1033_002chi", "source_sha256": "61a11f6b33be27e37d2090ab39f24947eda2f08fa96081d9f842d1a951f9ff64", "ja": "いえ！　……私が、いけないんです。\n私がお姉さまにも、静香にも甘えていたから……。", "zh": "不！……是我的错。\n因为我一直在依赖姐姐大人，也依赖静香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1034_002chi", "source_sha256": "5bdb3a7cdf226ed551593a77e0c9165f08742b7ac3b8fd76cba3f85791ff2b53", "ja": "静香に、琴葉さんというお姉さまができて。\n私は初めて、静香が感じていた寂しさを知りました。", "zh": "静香有了琴叶姐姐。\n我第一次知道了静香曾经感受到的寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "54d432a64aaf19bf6da24b00b11537e9082923500224280e8cfc5d0d8968ae18", "ja": "なのに……静香が、高坂さんという新しい友達と\n仲良くしている姿を見るのが、嫌だったんです……。", "zh": "可是……看到静香和新朋友高坂同学相处得那么好，我却很难受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1036_045kar", "source_sha256": "7770fefdc5776bfe018a26125be2ca181d2221eee4ffdc39ca70014dd91e0af0", "ja": "千早。昴さんに謝れる？\nもちろん、最上さんにもね。", "zh": "千早。能向昴先生道歉吗？\n当然，也要向最上先生道歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_04_1037_002chi", "source_sha256": "7c1fac7ece05c635834b827d11c0445de4b0b26b9eeb57baf6e083712fb9f289", "ja": "……はい。", "zh": "……好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
